{"id":"62f011418ee9c44e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-arithmetic-system.md","title":"Classical Arithmetic System","display":"df-arithmetic-system — Classical Arithmetic System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-arithmetic-system","aliases":["92-df-arithmetic-system"],"display":"df-arithmetic-system — Classical Arithmetic System","source":"第 V 章 pp. 56–57（PDF 73–74）；本地 Hilbert 呈现","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-formal-system]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","[[92-ax-generalization]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-arithmetic-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-arithmetic-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-system — Classical Arithmetic System"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 56–57（PDF 73–74）；本地 Hilbert 呈现"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span>：候选形式系统；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G,\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G,\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> 为已定义的本地语法与演算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G\\)</span> 是下文定义的候选三元组谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n(\\mathcal S=(\\Sigma_G,A,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\\land\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\subseteq A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n(\\mathcal S=(\\Sigma_G,A,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\\land\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\subseteq A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是把原书第 V 章任意算术理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 译入本库已有签名后的精确演算条件；它不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>、归纳、有效性、一致性或可靠性。各个定理必须另列所需条件。仅把七条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理放进任意三元组，却不给它一阶逻辑演算，不能套用算术不完备性定理。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 56–57（PDF 73–74）；本地 Hilbert 呈现。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]"